        "pageid": 71336115,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Angry Birds Reloaded",
        "extract": "Angry Birds Reloaded is a 2021 puzzle video game developed by Finnish video game developer Rovio Entertainment and is the nineteenth game in the Angry Birds franchise. The game was released exclusively for the Apple Arcade subscription service on July 16, 2021. It is inspired by the classic Angry Birds slingshot games, with the addition of new graphics as well as characters and settings from previous Angry Birds media.\n\n",
