        "title": "Aion 2",
        "extract": "Aion 2 is a Massively multiplayer online role-playing game developed and published by NC. It is a sequel to Aion, taking place 200 years after the events of the first game. The same conflict between the Elyos and Asmodians is featured in this game.\nThe game was released in South Korea and Taiwan on 19 November 2025 for PC and mobile devices. The global PC version of the game entered early access on 30 September 2026 and released on 5 October 2026.\n\n",
